<view class="page">
  <image class="stadium-bg" src="/images/runtime/team-data-emerald-stadium-v1.jpg" mode="aspectFill"></image><view class="shade"></view>
  <view class="content"><view class="page-title" wx:if="{{showTeamEmpty}}">球队</view>
    <view class="guest-mode-banner" wx:if="{{guestMode}}" bindtap="onSwitchWorkspace"><view><text>当前未登录</text><text>球队功能演示 · 示例数据不保存</text></view><text>去登录 ›</text></view>

    <view class="teams-hero" wx:if="{{hasTeams}}"><view><text class="teams-hero-title">我的球队</text></view></view>
    <view class="team-list" wx:if="{{hasTeams}}"><workspace-entry-card wx:for="{{teams}}" wx:key="key" entry="{{item}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindopen="onTeamTap"></workspace-entry-card></view>
    <button class="list-create-entry" wx:if="{{hasTeams}}" bindtap="onCreateTeam">＋ 创建球队</button>
    <view class="empty-team-panel" wx:if="{{showTeamEmpty}}"><view class="empty-mark"><image src="/images/logo-saixiaofeng.png" mode="aspectFit"></image></view><text class="empty-heading">当前还没有球队</text><text class="empty-copy">你可以先创建自己的长期球队，<br/>后续再通过主办方邀请加入赛事。</text><button class="empty-create" bindtap="onCreateTeam">创建球队</button></view>
    <view class="invite-note" wx:if="{{showTeamEmpty}}"><image src="/images/icons/shield.svg" mode="aspectFit"></image><text>受邀参加赛事？请从主办方发送的邀请链接进入，系统会自动识别是新建球队还是接收预建队伍。</text></view>
    <view class="loading" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在加载球队资产…</view><view class="error-card" wx:if="{{errorText}}">{{errorText}}</view>
    <view class="todo-section" wx:if="{{hasTasks}}"><text class="todo-title">赛事待办</text><view class="task-swipe-shell" wx:if="{{hasTasks}}" wx:for="{{teamTasks}}" wx:key="id"><view class="task-dismiss-action" wx:if="{{item.dismissible}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" catchtap="dismissTask">删除</view><view class="task-card" style="{{item.swipeStyle}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-tournament="{{item.tournamentId}}" data-team="{{item.teamId}}" catchtouchstart="onTaskTouchStart" catchtouchmove="onTaskTouchMove" catchtouchend="onTaskTouchEnd" bindtap="onTaskTap"><image src="/images/icons/list.svg" mode="aspectFit"></image><view><text>{{item.title}}</text></view><text class="todo-status">待处理</text><text class="arrow">›</text></view></view><view class="empty-card todo-empty" wx:if="{{!hasTasks}}">当前没有需要处理的赛事待办</view></view>
  </view>
  <quick-create-sheet id="quick-create" visible="{{createVisible}}" kind="team" bindclose="closeCreateSheet" bindcreated="onQuickCreated" bindcomplete="onQuickComplete"/>
</view>
